# NAME: StarDesk
# AUTHOR: Horatio
# FORMAT: Loon remote .lsr (policy-less)
# RULES: 2
# VERSION: 1.1.0
# UPDATED: 2026-11-26
# SOURCE: https://www.stardesk.net/
# SOURCE: https://www.stardesk.net/lp/main/
# USE: Assign DIRECT when subscribing; choose another policy if login requires it.
# SCOPE: Official service domain and subdomains, including the public download API.
# PROCESS-SOURCE: https://nsloon.app/docs/Rule/process_rule/
# PROCESS: StarDesk is the observed macOS executable name.
# COMPAT: Process matching is macOS only; mobile clients use the domain rule.
# LIMIT: Helper processes and unidentifiable IP-only traffic may not match.
# No guessed domains, shared cloud IP ranges, or generic UDP port rules.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,stardesk.net
PROCESS-NAME,StarDesk
